1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Boston is America's college city.
But walking into a room doesn't tell you who to sit with.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
So you tap in when you arrive.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Your phone shows who you already know here,

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
and which table needs you: Table 2 needs firmware.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Walk over and tap in together.
A join only counts when the whole group is at the station.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
[plucks play]

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
That's how a stranger becomes a teammate. Everyone earns points.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Last night [N] hackers checked in and formed [G] groups.

9
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Mentors see which tables are waiting for help,
and every help scan crosses a need off the board.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
ESP32 stations, a FastAPI server, Tiger Data, and Gemini icebreakers.

11
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Walk in. Tap in. Find your people. tapin.boston
